      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This might be a bit of a reach, but I have a feeling that OP is experiencing the behavior Continuous sync has when attached to a `Rigidbody` that goes to sleep. Something else in the project probably changed and the `RigidBody` is not sleeping as much anymore. This would then lead to OP noticing `OnDeserialization` happening way more frequently than they're used to seeing. This is all guesswork though.",
